o-5, and how social media helped authors break a publishing rule. Dan, meanwhile, promises her parenting gets easier (it doesn't) and discovers in real time that his research on her movie deal is a few years out of date.\n\n0:00-1:45 Intro\n1:45-3:45 Scheduling around family time\n3:45-10:15 Becoming a horror writer\n10:15-17:35 Maintaining your creative spark\n17:35-21:00 Advice to aspiring writers\n21:00-end Speed Round","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":574,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjfqpPNkYiXAxUsSfIAHflbHm3KAQTY8sI6","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=7iF5codBu3o\u0026pp=0gcJCWMAwfN6Pr3D","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"7iF5codBu3o","continuePlayback":true,"playerParams":"0gcJCWMAwfN6Pr3D","watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr1---sn-aj2im9-5q.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=ee2179728741bb7a\u0026ip=51.57.84.139\u0026initcwndbps=6422500\u0026mt=1790284193\u0026oweuc="}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"0 seconds"}}},{"startIndex":579,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjfqpPNkYiXAxUsSfIAHflbHm3KAQTY8sI6","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=7iF5codBu3o\u0026t=105s","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"7iF5codBu3o","continuePlayback":true,"startTimeSeconds":105,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr1---sn-aj2im9-5q.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=ee2179728741bb7a\u0026ip